@Fireworks.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5180

### Liveness. 200, Content-Type text/plain, body exactly "Healthy" — from the health check, never
### the SPA fallback (which would answer text/html).
GET {{Fireworks.Api_HostAddress}}/health/live

### Current user (plan §3.4). 200 { userId, displayName, isAuthenticated: false, canWrite }.
### canWrite is true in Development (appsettings.Development.json), false in production unless
### Identity__AllowAnonymousWrites=true is set.
GET {{Fireworks.Api_HostAddress}}/api/me
Accept: application/json

### Client tuning knobs (Show Builder playback). Anonymous, read-limited, Cache-Control: no-store.
### 200 { playback: { seekBudgetMs: 25, catchingUpDelayMs: 300, checkpointIntervalSeconds: 10,
### checkpointMemoryMiB: 64 } } from the ClientPlayback section; ClientPlayback__SeekBudgetMs=40 overrides.
GET {{Fireworks.Api_HostAddress}}/api/client-config
Accept: application/json

### Unknown API path. Must be 404 — NOT 200 text/html from the SPA fallback.
GET {{Fireworks.Api_HostAddress}}/api/nope
Accept: application/json

### Deep link. 200 text/html (index.html) once the Angular build is in wwwroot; 404 before that.
GET {{Fireworks.Api_HostAddress}}/designer

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Creations (Phase 4, docs/fireworks-app/schema.md §2). Development has canWrite: true. Run them in
### order: the create request names its response, and later requests read its share code.
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Create a shell. 201, Location: /api/creations/{shareCode}, body is a CreationResponse.
# @name create
POST {{Fireworks.Api_HostAddress}}/api/creations
Content-Type: application/json

{"kind":"shell","document":{"version":1,"name":"Peony","burstHeight":0.65,"angleJitter":4,"sky":{"gravity":160,"wind":0},"breaks":[{"pattern":"peony","stars":120,"speed":220,"color1":"red","color2":"gold","changeAt":0.65,"burn":1.6,"drag":0.9,"size":1,"trail":"none","effect":"none","delay":0.6}]}}

### Read it back. Public: no identity needed. 200, isOwner true, remixedFrom null.
GET {{Fireworks.Api_HostAddress}}/api/creations/{{create.response.body.shareCode}}
Accept: application/json

### Update original (owner only). 200, same share code, newer updatedAt.
PUT {{Fireworks.Api_HostAddress}}/api/creations/{{create.response.body.shareCode}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"document":{"version":1,"name":"Big Peony","burstHeight":0.7,"angleJitter":4,"sky":{"gravity":160,"wind":0},"breaks":[{"pattern":"peony","stars":200,"speed":240,"color1":"blue","color2":"none","changeAt":0.65,"burn":1.6,"drag":0.9,"size":1,"trail":"tail","effect":"none","delay":0.6}]}}

### Save as new (remix). 201, a new share code, remixedFrom = the source's code (you own the remix).
# @name remix
POST {{Fireworks.Api_HostAddress}}/api/creations/{{create.response.body.shareCode}}/remix
Content-Type: application/json

{"document":{"version":1,"name":"Peony remix","burstHeight":0.6,"angleJitter":6,"sky":{"gravity":160,"wind":-20},"breaks":[{"pattern":"ring","stars":90,"speed":200,"color1":"rainbow","color2":"none","changeAt":0.6,"burn":1.4,"drag":0.9,"size":1,"trail":"glitter","effect":"crackle","delay":0.6}]}}

### My creations. 200 { items, page, pageSize, totalCount }, newest first. page and pageSize are
### clamped (pageSize 1..100); kind must be exactly shell or show.
GET {{Fireworks.Api_HostAddress}}/api/me/creations?page=1&pageSize=24&kind=shell
Accept: application/json

### Invalid document. 400 { message, errors: [{ path, code, message }], truncated: false }:
### (breaks[0].stars, out-of-range) and (foo, unknown-property).
POST {{Fireworks.Api_HostAddress}}/api/creations
Content-Type: application/json

{"kind":"shell","document":{"version":1,"name":"Peony","burstHeight":0.65,"angleJitter":4,"foo":1,"breaks":[{"pattern":"peony","stars":401,"speed":220,"color1":"red","color2":"gold","changeAt":0.65,"burn":1.6,"drag":0.9,"size":1,"trail":"none","effect":"none","delay":0.6}]}}

### Wrong content type. 415 (an explicit check, not [Consumes]; a missing Content-Type is 415 too).
POST {{Fireworks.Api_HostAddress}}/api/creations
Content-Type: text/plain

{"kind":"shell","document":{}}

### Malformed share code (l, I, O, 0 aren't in the alphabet). 404 from the route constraint, no query.
GET {{Fireworks.Api_HostAddress}}/api/creations/abcdefgl

### Delete (owner only). 204; a second DELETE is 404. The remix survives with remixedFrom: null.
DELETE {{Fireworks.Api_HostAddress}}/api/creations/{{create.response.body.shareCode}}

### The remix after its source is gone. 200, remixedFrom null.
GET {{Fireworks.Api_HostAddress}}/api/creations/{{remix.response.body.shareCode}}
Accept: application/json
